  "extractionNotes": "Mandate contract (0411) with accident insurance since 2022-09-22 and voluntary sickness insurance from 2025-04-03 (ZUS insurance period 2025-04-03..2025-09-09; one payer form says 2025-04-01). Sickness in pregnancy 2025-07-14..2025-09-09 in three notes (payer remark), day 103 of voluntary cover, so the 90-day waiting period is met; ZUS issued a sickness-benefit decision and a maternity-benefit decision together (cover page), modelled here as paid history plus the maternity claim. Birth 2025-09-10, maternity application filed 2025-09-22 (day 12). ZUS benefit screen (decision dated 2025-10-17) prints 2025-09-10..2026-01-27 (140 days) and 2026-01-28..2026-09-08 (224 days), both 81.5%, 364 days in total. Declared contribution bases for April-June 2025 only; April is marked as not a full month of sickness insurance because cover started on the 3rd. Base and amounts not printed."
